  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional Magic Night Cat Pumpkin Lantern. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files please visit the Magic Night Cat Pumpkin Lantern on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Overview</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong>Magic Night Cat Pumpkin Lantern</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span></span></p>\n<!--Overview部分（无需改动）-->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<!--创作者计划注释（无需改动）-->\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\">To download the model files please visit the <strong>Magic Night Cat Pumpkin Lantern</strong> on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/zh/models/1924218-night-magic-cat-jack-o-lantern?from=search#profileId-2064917\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">MakerWorld</span></strong></span></a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">In The Box</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; border-collapse: collapse; height: 75px;\">\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr 